{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_15","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/sh -lc \"ls source_evidence; jq -r '.claims|to_entries[]|\\\"\\\\(.key): \\\\(.value.claim) SOURCES: \\\\(.value.source_ids|join(\\\",\\\"))\\\"' claims_grounding.json\"","aggregated_output":"benchmark_manifest.json\nbenchmark_manifest.json.prov.json\nestimator.py\nestimator.py.prov.json\nevaluate_final.py\nevaluate_final.py.prov.json\nfinal_manifest.json\nfinal_manifest.json.prov.json\niclr2026_conference.bst\niclr2026_conference.sty\nmissing_comparison_failure.json\nmissing_comparison_failure.json.prov.json\nmissing_comparison_stderr.log\nmissing_comparison_stderr.log.prov.json\nprogram_spec.toml\nprogram_spec.toml.prov.json\nrequirements.txt\nrequirements.txt.prov.json\ntask_contract.json\ntask_contract.json.prov.json\n0: The final evaluation completed and reports qualified; this does not establish statistical superiority or validity under arbitrary interference. SOURCES: final.qualification.status,final.qualification.outcome,final.qualification.correct\n1: There are 24 seed blocks, four families, six conditions and 576 completed scientific cases; none of their errors was clipped. SOURCES: final.evidence.episodes\n2: Endpoint-tuned equal-cell summaries: {\"rmse\": 0.6140475146408373, \"absolute_bias\": 0.45976914987682993, \"rmse_ci\": [0.5884918532711835, 0.6359217607129969], \"absolute_bias_ci\": [0.43057558945857266, 0.5135882034991923]} SOURCES: final.evidence.episodes\n3: Difference in means equal-cell summaries: {\"rmse\": 1.36760394415568, \"absolute_bias\": 1.3628332500117146, \"rmse_ci\": [1.3634901974428593, 1.3714947261621697], \"absolute_bias_ci\": [1.3592855016805454, 1.3668257006326443]} SOURCES: final.evidence.episodes\n4: Own-treatment OLS equal-cell summaries: {\"rmse\": 1.3676790101071885, \"absolute_bias\": 1.3634977506575554, \"rmse_ci\": [1.3635921605072203, 1.3716342104155554], \"absolute_bias_ci\": [1.3599239039673032, 1.3677833555063224]} SOURCES: fi