an2008\n75: Literature context only: Additional Results Concerning Estimable Functions and Generalized Inverse Matrices. Claims are restricted to the documented reading scope: Title and abstract only; no citation graph or related-content access SOURCES: ref.openalex.Searle1965\n76: Literature context only: On the Application of Probability Theory to Agricultural Experiments. Essay on Principles. Section 9. Claims are restricted to the documented reading scope: Title and abstract only; no citation graph or related-content access SOURCES: ref.openalex.Neyman1990\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
