ovariate widths:',sorted(set(data[record['key']+'_x'].shape[1] for record in manifest['records'])))\nprint('Downstream study present:', 'downstream_study' in paper)\nprint('Final metrics agree with manifest:',paper['final_evaluation']['metrics']==json.loads(Path('source_evidence/final_manifest.json').read_text())['metrics'])\nPY\"","aggregated_output":"SI exposure table: 8 rows, rounding discrepancies: []\nBenchmark archive matches manifest: True\nStanford3 edges: (568309, 2)\nManifest family node/edge dimensions: {'SBM': [(4096, 95912), (4096, 95991), (4096, 96100), (4096, 96146)], 'BA': [(4096, 20455)], 'WS': [(4096, 20480)], 'Stanford3': [(11586, 568309)]}\nCovariate widths: [1]\nDownstream study present: False\nFinal metrics agree with manifest: True\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
